      "guidance": "A stance page states the position the system this base serves takes on one topic, why it takes it, and what in the base supports or disputes it. Its status is the stance: considering, trying, adopted or rejected. record names the engineering record behind it, synthesizes the digests it rests on, recommends and advises_against the techniques adopted and passed over. A flag about the topic completes onto this page.",
